      "writtenOn": "2022-08-05T13:38:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I did it this was to try to make it less error-prone and more future-proof. If we change the default here, we won\u0027t have to update the Bazel rules.\n\nBazel won\u0027t let the flag be set to true and false, so this shouldn\u0027t be defined in two ways.\n\nIf you still prefer, I can do as you suggested.",
      "parentUuid": "647ee83d_2ac17351",
      "revId": "0774b994ac93dcfc046d907b577bee985290de1a",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
