      "writtenOn": "2022-08-05T15:23:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I\u0027d rather keep it the other way. If the default ever changes, it\u0027s going to mean we\u0027re deleting the code entirely anyway. I don\u0027t love that the only external option is a negative, but that\u0027s just how skia tends to operate (to support staging changes for the few clients that need to slowly opt-in to things).",
